Costillas de Res en Chile Verde:
10-12 small tomatillos
2 jalapenos
2-3 serrano peppers
1/2 onion
4 garlic cloves
handful of cilantro
1 cup water
chicken buillion to taste
1lb flank short ribs
1. in a pan with oil, roast onion, garlic, peppers & tomatillos until tomatillos turn a deeper green color & jalapenos have softened. make sure not to burn garlic
2. in a blender, add roasted onions, peppers, etc along with cilantro, water & chicken buillion, blend well & set aside
3. on medium heat, cook short ribs for 3-5 minutes on each side or until golden brown on both sides, add 1/4 thinly sliced onion & saute for 1 minute
4. Add chile to pan & simmer on medium-low heat for 20-30 mins or until the beef is tender

Mexican Rice:
1 cup jasmine rice
1 tomato
1/4 onion
2 garlic cloves
chicken knorr + tomato knorr
2 cups water


Collard Greens:
Collard Greens
Ham Hock / Turkey Necks
Red Pepper Flakes
Choice of Seasonings
Chicken Buillion
Onion
1. Season choice of ham hocks or turkey necks. Then chop onions & put in a large pot of water, fill with water & set to boil.
2. Once it begins boiling, add chicken buillion & set temperature to medium-low
